WEBVTT

00:02.330 --> 00:03.610
<i>How...</i>

00:05.480 --> 00:06.780
<i>How...</i>

00:09.650 --> 00:11.650
<i>did this happen?</i>

00:14.140 --> 00:17.650
<i>Death Incarnate dwells in the forest.</i>

00:18.620 --> 00:22.080
<i>He takes the life of whatever he touches.</i>

00:22.080 --> 00:26.040
<i>That was the curse the witch put on him.</i>

00:26.750 --> 00:31.510
<i>Why did the witch curse him? 
How can the curse be broken?</i>

00:31.780 --> 00:34.980
<i>The answer remains hidden.</i>

00:36.130 --> 00:41.580
<i>And yet, he doesn't feel 
the least bit lonely.</i>

02:12.980 --> 02:16.630
Episode 13
 The Duke, Alice, and the Magic Pool

02:21.880 --> 02:22.900
Your Grace.

02:23.630 --> 02:25.180
Alice, you scared me!

02:25.180 --> 02:27.550
You're too close! But I guess 
you're always too close.

02:27.550 --> 02:30.910
I knocked, but there was no answer.

02:30.910 --> 02:32.120
Oh, yeah?

02:32.120 --> 02:33.750
I guess I was focusing.

02:34.440 --> 02:36.200
A card tower?

02:36.200 --> 02:38.010
You're quite good with your hands.

02:38.940 --> 02:41.740
The way you were panicking a moment ago,

02:41.740 --> 02:45.290
I assumed you were by yourself because you 
didn't want me to see what you were doing.

02:45.650 --> 02:46.600
What's that supposed to mean?

02:46.990 --> 02:49.040
You have no idea at all?

02:49.040 --> 02:52.170
No! So stay away from me!

02:52.170 --> 02:54.230
You'll die if you touch me!

02:55.200 --> 02:57.820
I couldn't help myself. 
The way you reacted was so cute.

02:58.110 --> 02:59.690
Be careful!

02:59.690 --> 03:02.540
If you died, I'd die too.

03:02.540 --> 03:03.420
Why?

03:03.420 --> 03:07.060
Why? Because I love you.

03:07.060 --> 03:11.080
Oh my. That's even cuter, Your Grace.

03:17.210 --> 03:21.570
<i>I want Alice to think I'm cool, not cute!</i>

03:22.070 --> 03:24.720
<i>Just watch! I'll do something 
awesome to impress her!</i>

03:26.250 --> 03:28.490
<i>Well, she's certainly watching.</i>

03:29.010 --> 03:30.620
I want to concentrate on placing the cards.

03:30.620 --> 03:33.030
Can you hand them to me?

03:33.030 --> 03:33.600
Of course,

03:33.730 --> 03:34.710
Your Grace.

03:34.710 --> 03:36.190
Don't put them there!

03:36.530 --> 03:38.650
I'll put some here, too.

03:39.090 --> 03:41.860
<i>I can't concentrate at all!</i>

03:42.090 --> 03:45.590
I love seeing you so serious.

03:45.590 --> 03:48.870
Please, just let me focus!

03:52.160 --> 03:55.130
I know I've got more important 
things I should be doing.

03:57.230 --> 04:00.760
My mother gave me that time limit.

04:01.560 --> 04:02.470
Yes.

04:03.900 --> 04:06.030
You must break your curse 
by spring at the latest.

04:08.410 --> 04:11.130
I don't like it, but...

04:12.290 --> 04:15.770
In her own way, she'd been 
waiting for me this whole time.

04:16.190 --> 04:17.960
I want to make her happy.

04:18.270 --> 04:21.430
Honestly, I'd be fine with 
Walter becoming the next heir.

04:22.970 --> 04:26.080
If you cannot, then I shall 
make Walter the heir.

04:27.060 --> 04:31.610
Of course, I want to break the curse, 
and not because I want to be heir.

04:31.610 --> 04:33.900
Cuff and Zain are helping me.

04:33.900 --> 04:37.290
More than anything, I want to do it for you.

04:37.730 --> 04:39.040
Your Grace...

04:50.790 --> 04:54.890
Alice!

05:17.080 --> 05:21.710
Have you enjoyed this night 
filled with mystery and wonder?

05:21.710 --> 05:27.090
This concludes tonight's 
Circus Gemini performance.

05:33.560 --> 05:35.180
The crowd loved you, Cuff!

05:35.560 --> 05:37.820
Tonight's show was so cool!

05:37.820 --> 05:41.940
I never would've had this much 
fun if I'd stayed a pickpocket!

05:42.280 --> 05:45.590
Thanks for inviting me here, Cuff!

05:45.590 --> 05:47.700
You should thank the Ringmaster 
for inviting you here.

05:50.090 --> 05:51.310
Just you wait.

05:51.310 --> 05:53.080
I'll get even better at my tricks

05:53.080 --> 05:55.880
and become a big-time man who's worthy of you!

06:00.130 --> 06:04.460
Hugo, you are far too young 
to be trying to seduce girls.

06:04.460 --> 06:06.080
Let me go, Zain!

06:06.080 --> 06:07.910
Or I'll rip that weird 
mask right off your face!

06:07.910 --> 06:09.600
I'd like to see you try—

06:09.600 --> 06:10.600
Ow! Ow!

06:10.600 --> 06:11.890
Ringmaster!

06:11.890 --> 06:14.950
He's bothering me! Make him go away!

06:14.950 --> 06:15.470
Sure.

06:16.380 --> 06:18.640
It's past your bedtime, kid.

06:18.640 --> 06:21.010
Do you all pick me up the same way?

06:21.010 --> 06:22.610
<i>Why</i> do you all pick me up the same way?

06:23.480 --> 06:28.220
I'm glad you guys came. 
The audience loves you.

06:28.220 --> 06:29.380
Night.

06:29.380 --> 06:30.410
Damn it!

06:30.410 --> 06:31.630
Cuff, good night!

06:31.630 --> 06:33.240
Zain, go screw yourself!

06:33.240 --> 06:34.240
See you tomorrow!

06:34.240 --> 06:36.210
Right, good night!

06:36.810 --> 06:41.270
That kid might not like me, 
but he's a hard worker.

06:41.270 --> 06:44.180
He said he wants to work 
here and support his family.

06:44.180 --> 06:48.180
Yup. He was only stealing because 
he didn't have a choice.

06:48.180 --> 06:52.180
This is the first time I've ever been 
given a flower. I think I like it!

06:52.460 --> 06:53.550
Well...

06:54.100 --> 06:55.900
I'll get you a flower too, then!

06:55.900 --> 06:58.120
One this big!

06:58.120 --> 06:59.640
Oh, uh, thanks.

07:03.130 --> 07:04.520
Hey, Cuff.

07:05.020 --> 07:07.080
How long are we going to stay here?

07:07.540 --> 07:13.980
It's close to Alice and the Duke, and nobody 
asks questions about how I look, but...

07:13.980 --> 07:18.830
We need to get out of here before 
they find out we're witches.

07:18.830 --> 07:20.870
I don't want to cause 
problems for the circus.

07:21.350 --> 07:24.840
But... I don't want to leave this place.

07:27.800 --> 07:31.290
Oh, right! I just remembered something!

07:34.270 --> 07:36.310
Last time I went to the Witches' World,

07:36.310 --> 07:40.770
I swiped some magic items 
while Daleth wasn't looking.

07:40.770 --> 07:42.930
You're no better than Hugo.

07:42.930 --> 07:46.730
They were just sitting in an 
old storeroom. Nobody will notice.

07:47.120 --> 07:48.230
And...

07:48.570 --> 07:50.680
<i>Daleth owes me.</i>

07:51.620 --> 07:54.200
<i>She hasn't let me fondle 
even one of her boobs!</i>

07:54.200 --> 07:55.550
And what?

07:55.550 --> 07:57.080
No, nothing!

08:00.340 --> 08:01.080
Here.

08:06.590 --> 08:08.980
Look at all this stuff!

08:08.980 --> 08:11.430
Let's take them with us next time 
we go see Alice and the Duke!

08:11.430 --> 08:14.500
One of them might help break his curse!

08:15.880 --> 08:19.520
What do you want to live as?
A witch or a human?

08:20.270 --> 08:24.210
If you don't use your magic, 
you can pass as a human.

08:25.640 --> 08:29.120
You've got friends here. 
You wouldn't be alone.

08:30.800 --> 08:34.180
<i>And it would be less dangerous 
than staying with me.</i>

08:35.480 --> 08:38.080
I'm cold. Let me inside your jacket.

08:44.990 --> 08:50.280
I don't care if I'm a human or 
a witch... as long as I'm with you.

08:50.280 --> 08:52.300
Oh. I see.

08:54.190 --> 08:55.260
<i>Boobs!</i>

08:55.260 --> 08:58.970
<b>Emptiness</b>

08:56.490 --> 08:58.030
<i>Her boobs are touching me!</i>

09:00.280 --> 09:01.650
<i>G Cup!</i>

09:08.500 --> 09:10.770
Every time I see it, I want it more.

09:12.000 --> 09:15.850
The magic to control time...

09:19.200 --> 09:22.420
You agree, don't you, Sharon?

09:47.010 --> 09:49.170
There you are, Viola.

09:50.650 --> 09:54.220
I'm glad you're still here. I thought 
you might've gone to see the eldest son.

09:54.220 --> 09:57.270
If I want to go, that's my choice, right?

09:57.270 --> 10:01.040
Mother never told me I couldn't.

10:01.370 --> 10:03.530
That's our grandfather and grandmother.

10:03.530 --> 10:04.590
Yes.

10:04.590 --> 10:06.620
I know it's a painting, but still,

10:06.620 --> 10:09.080
every time I see her, I can't 
help but think how cute she is.

10:09.660 --> 10:12.620
I can see why Grandfather 
was so in love with her.

10:12.620 --> 10:13.710
Yes.

10:13.710 --> 10:17.670
She died in a carriage accident 
shortly after Father was born.

10:18.490 --> 10:22.010
And he never remarried.

10:22.930 --> 10:24.820
He was probably so lonely.

10:29.800 --> 10:31.940
Perhaps I'm starting to see things...

10:31.940 --> 10:33.280
Sorry to interrupt!

10:33.280 --> 10:34.150
Cuff?

10:35.780 --> 10:37.440
Was I really interrupting?

10:37.440 --> 10:38.920
No, not at all!

10:38.920 --> 10:40.280
It's been a while.

10:40.600 --> 10:45.740
The circus has been so busy lately
that I haven't been able to drop by.

10:45.740 --> 10:48.210
We're just glad you came.

10:48.610 --> 10:51.580
We can't really go into town.

10:52.460 --> 10:55.250
I love it here 'cause I can 
use all the magic I want!

10:55.250 --> 10:57.210
You'll burn the mansion down!

10:57.210 --> 11:00.770
Don't worry! These flames are magic,
 and do whatever I want!

11:00.770 --> 11:02.690
When they disappear, they leave
 nothing behind at all!

11:02.690 --> 11:04.410
Well, that's okay, then.

11:04.410 --> 11:07.210
But it's really hot in here now...

11:07.600 --> 11:08.690
Right?

11:08.690 --> 11:10.810
It's like the middle of summer, right?

11:12.170 --> 11:14.360
So let's take a dip in the pool!

11:16.800 --> 11:17.750
Pool?

11:18.170 --> 11:20.560
I recognize this design.

11:20.560 --> 11:22.790
Zain brought it from the Witches' World.

11:22.790 --> 11:24.620
Now that I've heated up the room,

11:24.620 --> 11:26.560
we can enjoy the pool even though 
it's the middle of winter!

11:26.560 --> 11:28.630
He even chose our swimsuits!

11:28.630 --> 11:30.730
You sure can tell what he likes...

11:30.730 --> 11:32.660
So, where is he?

11:33.300 --> 11:34.840
Oh, he's...

11:34.840 --> 11:36.500
Listen carefully, Cuff.

11:36.500 --> 11:38.580
When you go swimming with 
Alice in your swimsuits,

11:38.580 --> 11:40.850
make sure you invite me!

11:40.850 --> 11:43.340
It's dangerous for two girls 
to be in the water alone!

11:43.340 --> 11:45.890
You need me to keep watch!

11:45.890 --> 11:47.140
You need me, okay?!

11:47.490 --> 11:48.850
I left him at home.

11:49.570 --> 11:52.130
Anyway, Alice, let's get in the pool.

11:52.130 --> 11:53.460
It's so hot!

11:53.460 --> 11:55.000
All right, just a moment.

11:55.000 --> 11:56.490
What are you doing?

11:56.490 --> 12:00.280
It's so hot in here, I thought I'd take 
off my clothes before getting my swimsuit.

12:00.280 --> 12:01.830
Get the swimsuit first!

12:01.830 --> 12:05.130
Both of you, please change in another room!

12:05.130 --> 12:06.830
I already changed, though.

12:06.830 --> 12:07.870
That was fast!

12:11.060 --> 12:13.830
<i>I can't look...</i>

12:14.870 --> 12:17.370
<i>And Alice is right here.</i>

12:17.370 --> 12:20.230
I'll go change in my room, then.

12:27.090 --> 12:28.780
I have returned.

12:30.050 --> 12:32.270
<i>She's so cute...</i>

12:32.970 --> 12:35.020
You had your own swimsuit, then.

12:35.020 --> 12:35.780
Yes.

12:35.780 --> 12:39.050
I assumed I'd get a chance 
to show it to you someday.

12:39.050 --> 12:42.260
Hooray! Hooray! Hooray!

12:39.700 --> 12:42.220
You're not getting in the pool?

12:42.220 --> 12:43.460
I'll pass.

12:43.460 --> 12:44.990
You two have fun.

12:45.320 --> 12:48.270
You can sit there and watch us...

12:48.270 --> 12:49.350
all you like.

12:49.350 --> 12:50.450
Okay...

12:56.090 --> 12:57.920
The water feels so good.

12:58.150 --> 12:59.880
Whee! Splash!

13:00.190 --> 13:03.310
<i>Alice is so pretty.</i>

13:04.040 --> 13:07.040
<i>Zain is gonna be so mad later.</i>

13:07.040 --> 13:08.010
It's not fair!

13:09.440 --> 13:10.970
Hey, Cuff.

13:12.140 --> 13:14.630
You said you've been busy with the circus.

13:14.630 --> 13:17.980
Do the people there know you're a witch?

13:17.980 --> 13:20.440
No, I don't think they do.

13:20.660 --> 13:23.150
Why did you join the circus, anyway?

13:23.150 --> 13:25.130
Well...

13:25.450 --> 13:28.070
You guys ever thought 
about joining the circus?

13:28.070 --> 13:30.950
We don't get a lot of customers, 
but every day is fun!

13:31.330 --> 13:35.390
The place is always on the verge 
of bankruptcy, but it's a nice place.

13:35.390 --> 13:39.490
Lately we've had more customers, so it's busy.

13:39.490 --> 13:41.690
I'd love to go see you some day.

13:41.690 --> 13:43.040
Right, Alice?

13:43.040 --> 13:43.750
Yes.

13:43.750 --> 13:46.000
Any time! We'd always be happy to see you!

13:46.000 --> 13:46.720
Kyah!

13:46.720 --> 13:50.560
<i>Kyah! Kyah! Kyah!</i>

13:49.470 --> 13:52.450
<i>She's so cute...</i>

13:52.450 --> 13:55.130
Now it's your turn to splash 
me as hard as you can!

13:55.130 --> 13:56.450
We can have a splash fight!

13:56.450 --> 13:57.140
Of course.

13:59.360 --> 14:01.990
You're so nice...

14:02.990 --> 14:04.280
What are you doing?

14:05.730 --> 14:10.240
I thought I could help you feel 
like you're on a tropical island.

14:10.240 --> 14:12.880
It's not just the piano. You can paint, too.

14:13.510 --> 14:14.240
Thanks.

14:15.590 --> 14:18.210
<i>Oh no... It's a little too hot.</i>

14:18.550 --> 14:21.050
<i>I'm getting dizzy.</i>

14:22.090 --> 14:23.420
Your Grace.

14:23.690 --> 14:27.650
You seem hot. Why don't you join us?

14:28.080 --> 14:30.590
The water is cold and feels so good.

14:31.370 --> 14:36.840
No, I... I don't like baring my skin.

14:37.390 --> 14:39.230
<i>Oh no!</i>

14:59.560 --> 15:01.260
Alice, are you okay?

15:01.260 --> 15:02.920
Yes, I'm fine.

15:05.180 --> 15:07.550
I need to make sure I'm staying hydrated.

15:07.550 --> 15:09.630
It's hot. We need to be careful.

15:10.120 --> 15:13.140
I've started to turn red myself.

15:18.400 --> 15:21.060
That was so much fun!

15:21.460 --> 15:24.020
I'm heading home, but you guys can have that.

15:24.350 --> 15:25.860
Th-Thanks.

15:26.090 --> 15:28.500
And this is from Zain.

15:28.500 --> 15:30.730
A box? What's inside?

15:30.730 --> 15:32.030
He didn't say.

15:32.280 --> 15:34.250
I randomly grabbed a bunch of stuff!

15:34.250 --> 15:36.830
So I'll have him try them out for me!

15:37.240 --> 15:38.820
That's what he said.

15:38.820 --> 15:40.960
Am I his guinea pig?

15:46.440 --> 15:49.210
Perhaps it's part of a series?

15:49.210 --> 15:51.340
Yeah, probably.

15:58.890 --> 16:00.980
"Sweet dreams."

16:01.460 --> 16:03.290
What does it do, I wonder?

16:03.290 --> 16:05.700
Something they use in the Witches' 
World to help them sleep, perhaps?

16:05.700 --> 16:08.730
That would definitely be a nightmare.

16:08.730 --> 16:12.700
Well, Zain gave it to me. 
It can't be that dangerous.

16:13.050 --> 16:15.450
Rustle, rustle, rustle...

16:16.980 --> 16:18.260
Pop!

16:19.160 --> 16:21.120
Oh?

16:24.970 --> 16:25.920
It's empty?

16:27.930 --> 16:29.120
Your Grace?

16:35.720 --> 16:36.970
What is this place?

16:36.970 --> 16:38.680
Welcome, Your Grace.

16:39.560 --> 16:41.640
Alice? Why are you dressed like that?

16:41.640 --> 16:42.560
I'm a bunny girl.

16:42.560 --> 16:44.320
No, I get that, but...

16:44.320 --> 16:48.730
In this place, your wishes become real.

16:48.730 --> 16:50.780
M-My wishes?

16:50.780 --> 16:52.070
I see.

16:52.070 --> 16:55.710
So this will allow me to see 
into your fantasies, then.

16:55.710 --> 16:56.410
Alice?

16:56.410 --> 16:57.950
No, this is...

16:58.240 --> 17:00.410
You like bunny girls, then?

17:00.410 --> 17:02.660
I'll get you for this, Zain!

17:02.660 --> 17:07.230
Since this world is a fantasy, 
is it safe to touch His Grace?

17:07.230 --> 17:08.250
Of course.

17:08.500 --> 17:10.710
Would you like to touch me, Young Master?

17:10.710 --> 17:12.520
I'll just watch.

17:14.500 --> 17:16.750
Please, no!

17:16.750 --> 17:19.110
O-Oh, what's behind that door?

17:19.110 --> 17:20.390
Oh, this?

17:21.210 --> 17:24.910
It contains more of your fantasies.

17:24.910 --> 17:26.100
I'll show you around.

17:26.360 --> 17:28.690
D-Do I have to go?

17:28.690 --> 17:32.750
I've got the feeling Alice might see 
something even more embarrassing...

17:32.750 --> 17:34.680
I'm very curious.

17:35.300 --> 17:36.930
I want to see, too.

17:36.930 --> 17:38.230
We agree, then.

17:38.230 --> 17:39.820
You're the same person!

17:40.110 --> 17:42.290
Let's just go.

17:48.090 --> 17:50.330
Oh, look at all of me!

17:50.330 --> 17:52.190
I'm so s-sorry.

17:52.190 --> 17:54.200
There's nothing to apologize for.

17:54.200 --> 17:56.510
Something like this is healthy, actually.

17:57.360 --> 18:00.470
I'm feeling nothing but 
shame and embarrassment.

18:00.470 --> 18:02.020
Why am I being forced to suffer like this?

18:02.020 --> 18:04.290
I'm quite enjoying it.

18:04.290 --> 18:07.450
I need to write down what 
you like before I forget.

18:07.450 --> 18:08.230
Please no!

18:08.480 --> 18:10.730
Okay, next.

18:12.630 --> 18:14.050
Dear Brother!

18:14.050 --> 18:14.980
Viola?

18:14.980 --> 18:18.490
Um, there's something on this 
music sheet I can't read.

18:18.490 --> 18:20.820
Tell me what this means again!

18:20.820 --> 18:24.660
"Allegretto. Moderately fast,
 slower than allegro."

18:24.660 --> 18:25.680
Thank you!

18:25.680 --> 18:27.670
You're so amazing, Dearest Brother!

18:27.670 --> 18:30.370
I'm so proud to be your little sister!

18:30.370 --> 18:32.190
Is this a fantasy, too?

18:32.190 --> 18:35.100
Yeah, and it's making me sad.

18:35.100 --> 18:36.880
Let's keep going.

18:51.230 --> 18:52.230
Wow...

18:54.370 --> 18:56.880
If I could play the piano 
in a place like this...

18:57.320 --> 18:58.870
It would be so much fun, I'm sure.

19:00.480 --> 19:02.530
Will you play, then?

19:03.550 --> 19:04.280
I can?

19:04.280 --> 19:06.660
Yes. This is your fantasy, after all.

20:02.440 --> 20:04.300
That was wonderful, Your Grace.

20:05.400 --> 20:07.010
Thank you.

20:07.280 --> 20:09.470
Did you enjoy that?

20:09.470 --> 20:10.120
Yeah.

20:10.120 --> 20:11.850
I know it's just my own fantasy, though.

20:12.670 --> 20:14.850
This is a wonderful world.

20:15.170 --> 20:16.640
Let's look around a little more.

20:16.640 --> 20:21.360
Um, Alice, I'd rather call it a night...

20:21.930 --> 20:24.750
I want to see the depths of your desire.

20:24.750 --> 20:26.320
That's a really scary thing to say!

20:48.570 --> 20:52.100
A-Alice, what did you see?

20:52.100 --> 20:57.030
Your Grace, I didn't know you 
imagined me looking like that.

20:57.030 --> 20:58.270
Wait, what?

20:58.270 --> 20:59.150
There's more?

20:59.450 --> 21:01.780
Now, let's get going.

21:01.780 --> 21:06.560
H-Hold it! What did you see? Alice? Alice!

21:02.520 --> 21:04.790
I'll show you to the exit.

21:11.160 --> 21:14.840
I loved playing the piano, 
but this box is scary.

21:14.840 --> 21:17.440
Zain, why did you give me this?

21:17.440 --> 21:19.580
I'll put this away.

21:19.580 --> 21:21.710
Yeah. Make sure you lock it up tight.

21:23.000 --> 21:26.300
It did make me happy, though.

